        "PMC8200011::web::025::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed treatment cools the coating to approximately -196°C, holds it for 12 hours, and then tempers it at approximately 200°C.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlling the DCT cooling rate and tempering profile will refine the coating microstructure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11355962::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized DCT will form fine nanoscale secondary precipitates in the coating.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized DCT will increase dislocation density in the coating.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized DCT and tempering treatment will reduce residual stresses in the coating.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will avoid or minimize detrimental thermally induced microcracking.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8200011::web::025::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "DCT promotes additional phase transformation in the CoCrFeNiMo0.85 coating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11355962::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "DCT promotes homogenization within the CoCrFeNiMo0.85 coating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A controlled cooling rate minimizes thermal shock.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tempering at approximately 200°C mitigates microcrack formation by relieving residual stresses.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain-boundary strengthening and dislocation pinning from the modified microstructure improve hardness and wear resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11190891::web::023::theoretical_model",
        "PMC11509624::web::015::3_3_hardness_and_wear_analysis"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
